    "description": "<blockquote><p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered one or more Classes among <strong>Dungeoneer</strong> and <strong>Tinkerer</strong>, and must have learned the <strong>Vast Collection</strong> skill.</p></blockquote><p>When you use your <strong>Vast Collection</strong> feature, you can choose an <strong>Artifact</strong> of your choice that you have seen or heard of before. You create a temporary copy of the item, that functions exactly as the item would have, for a short time. When you acquire an Artifact in this way, the duration it may stay is determined by the <strong>Game Master</strong>, rather than till the end of the scene.</p><p>An incredibly potent Artifact like the Final Feather may only last a few moments, whereas something more like the Astroscope may last for a few days.</p>",
